<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>The PLOT_ACTIONSTATE constants:
</p>
<ul><li>0 - Invalid  - action will not appear in the control.</li>
<li>1 - Enabled  - action appears in the control and can be activated by the user unless the control is disabled</li>
<li>2 - Disabled - action has been already used by the user and cannot be used again.</li>
<li>3 - Active   - action is currently active.</li></ul>
